{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/12973adab6c751ee643b008b0b412c8d.avif?t=1759782682\" width=250 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Axo Runner it\u2019s a kart racing game with a simple goal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beat them all!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Compete for the first place and show everyone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">who is the fastest axolotl in the lake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/d0f02ba93f49741231987dcdd1dd5783.poster.avif?t=1759782682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/d0f02ba93f49741231987dcdd1dd5783.webm?t=1759782682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/d0f02ba93f49741231987dcdd1dd5783.mp4?t=1759782682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick your favorite character from Axo Aventuras or one of the guest characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">from the Villainous series to compete for the gold cup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Obtain items from the item bubbles and use them to take the advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drifting is the key to obtain more speed, don't forget it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/36c0d5012aa8ac951c9f3b7046a2c566.poster.avif?t=1759782682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/36c0d5012aa8ac951c9f3b7046a2c566.webm?t=1759782682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/36c0d5012aa8ac951c9f3b7046a2c566.mp4?t=1759782682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/4e0652ed379aabd98ad443f8c04c5a40.webp?t=1759782682\" width=450 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/8a109a9c3a002386c7a59cb6c31fd876.avif?t=1759782682\" width=400 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/422c55d7376cd782213a64fbf0a36101.webp?t=1759782682\" width=473 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702730/extras/7abefe5312e90373ccbd65875c3b520b.avif?t=1759782682\" width=400 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://st